<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: '"Microsoft YaHei", Arial, sans-serif', position: 'relative' }}>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 0, top: 0, width: 1280, height: 76, background: '#1E4FA8', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: '0 60px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>四个关键决策：为什么这样设计</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#BFD0EA' }}>03 · 详细设计</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 100, width: 570, height: 210, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 20, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>① 外键用 RESTRICT</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>已产生预约的会议室不允许直接删除，数据库层直接拒绝，接口回 409「存在预约记录，无法删除」。要删，先强制取消相关预约。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 650, top: 100, width: 570, height: 210, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 20, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>② reserve_date 冗余存储</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>按日查询走 idx_reservation_date_status 索引；若写 DATE(start_time) 会让索引失效。冗余字段由同一次写入赋值，另有 CHECK 约束兜底。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 330, width: 570, height: 210, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 20, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>③ 状态流转不写定时器</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>需求里没有定时任务功能。待开始／进行中／已结束在读取时按当前时间推导，更新记录时再校正落库，不引入调度组件。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 650, top: 330, width: 570, height: 210, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 20, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>④ 操作日志不级联删除</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>日志的 operator_id 是普通外键，不设 CASCADE；并冗余存当时角色快照——用户后来升为管理员，历史日志仍如实反映当时身份。</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 568, width: 1160, height: 64, background: '#E8EFF8', display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 24px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230' }}>四个决策的共同取向：能用数据库约束保证的，不在应用层"记得做"；能用一次写入保证的，不引入第二个组件。</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 660, width: 1160, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>智能会议室管理系统 V1.0 · 第 4 组答辩</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>14 / 20</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
